    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96708" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλιτ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inscribe on a</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήλη, τὴν κατάραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.354b
				</span></i>
			; <i>record</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἀρετὰς ἐν ταῖς γραφαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.2
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.24
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὀνόματα αὐτῶν ἐστηλιτεύθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philoch.
					111
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλοκοπέω, ἐστηλίτευσαν,
					ἐστηλιτευμένος</span>
			 cited among forms of punishment by <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.73
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀπογνωσθέντες ὑπ᾽ αὐτῶν καὶ
				-ευθέντες</span>
			<i>held up to public scorn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				35.252
			</span></i>.</div>
